{"id": "3326730", "name": "אינטגרל כפול – פיצול האינטגרנד וחישוב בשני סדרים", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "none", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 2, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>חשבו את האינטגרל</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\(\\displaystyle I= \\iint_D \\left({{CT:0}}+{{CT:1}}\\right)\\,dx\\,dy \\)</p><p>כאשר:</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\(\\displaystyle D= \\left\\{ (x,y): 0\\le x\\le{{CT:2}},\\ 0\\le y\\le{{CT:3}},\\ {{CT:4}}+{{CT:5}}\\ge1 \\right\\} \\)</p></div><p><b>הרעיון:</b> פצלו תחילה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle I=I_x+I_y\\)</span>. את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle I_x\\)</span> חשבו בסדר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle dy\\,dx\\)</span>, ואת <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle I_y\\)</span> בסדר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle dx\\,dy\\)</span>.</p><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#4b1f6f;color:#fff;margin-left:8px\">א׳</span>האיבר התלוי ב־<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle x\\)</span></div><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\(\\displaystyle I_x= \\int_0^{{{CT:2}}} \\int_{a(x)}^{{{CT:3}}} {{CT:0}}\\,dy\\,dx \\)</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(\\displaystyle a(x)=\\) [[input:ans1]] &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; \\(\\displaystyle I_x=\\) [[input:ans2]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]] [[validation:ans2]]</div></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#4b1f6f;color:#fff;margin-left:8px\">ב׳</span>האיבר התלוי ב־<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle y\\)</span></div><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\(\\displaystyle I_y= \\int_0^{{{CT:3}}} \\int_{c(y)}^{{{CT:2}}} {{CT:1}}\\,dx\\,dy \\)</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(\\displaystyle c(y)=\\) [[input:ans3]] &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; \\(\\displaystyle I_y=\\) [[input:ans4]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans3]] [[validation:ans4]]</div></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#4b1f6f;color:#fff;margin-left:8px\">ג׳</span>התוצאה הסופית</div><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(\\displaystyle I=\\) [[input:ans5]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans5]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> מפצלים את האינטגרנד לשני מחוברים, ומחשבים כל אחד בסדר שבו האינטגרציה הפנימית יוצרת גורם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x\\)</span> או <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(y\\)</span> שמאפשר הצבה.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — פיצול האינטגרל</b><br><p>נכתוב <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle I=I_x+I_y\\)</span>, כאשר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle I_x=\\iint_D{{CT:0}}\\,dA\\)</span> ו-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle I_y=\\iint_D{{CT:1}}\\,dA\\)</span>. התחום <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(D\\)</span> הוא המשולש שבמלבן מעל הישר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle {{CT:4}}+{{CT:5}}=1\\)</span>, שעובר דרך <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(({{CT:2}},0)\\)</span> ו-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\((0,{{CT:3}})\\)</span>.</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — חישוב <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(I_x\\)</span> בסדר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(dy\\,dx\\)</span> (סעיף א׳)</b><br><p>מן הישר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle {{CT:4}}+{{CT:5}}=1\\)</span> נקבל <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(y={{CT:6}}\\)</span>, ולכן בסריקה אנכית</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\(\\displaystyle 0\\le x\\le{{CT:2}}, \\qquad {{CT:7}}\\le y\\le{{CT:3}} \\)</p><p>האינטגרנד אינו תלוי ב-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(y\\)</span>, ולכן האינטגרל הפנימי הוא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:0}}\\cdot\\left({{CT:3}}-\\left({{CT:6}}\\right)\\right)={{CT:8}}\\)</span>. הגורם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x\\)</span> שנוצר מאפשר הצבה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(t=x^2\\)</span>:</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\(\\displaystyle I_x= \\int_0^{{{CT:2}}}\\int_{{{CT:7}}}^{{{CT:3}}}{{CT:0}}\\,dy\\,dx ={{CT:9}} \\)</p><p>בחירה בסדר ההפוך הייתה מחייבת אינטגרציה ישירה לפי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x\\)</span> של פונקציה מן הצורה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(e^{cx^2}\\)</span>, <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\sin(cx^2)\\)</span> או <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\cos(cx^2)\\)</span>.</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 3 — חישוב <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(I_y\\)</span> בסדר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(dx\\,dy\\)</span> (סעיף ב׳)</b><br><p>בסריקה אופקית מתקבל</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\(\\displaystyle 0\\le y\\le{{CT:3}}, \\qquad {{CT:10}}\\le x\\le{{CT:2}} \\)</p><p>האינטגרל הפנימי הוא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:1}}\\cdot\\left({{CT:2}}-\\left({{CT:11}}\\right)\\right)={{CT:12}}\\)</span>, ושוב מחשבים בהצבה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(t=y^2\\)</span>:</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\(\\displaystyle I_y= \\int_0^{{{CT:3}}}\\int_{{{CT:10}}}^{{{CT:2}}}{{CT:1}}\\,dx\\,dy ={{CT:13}} \\)</p><p>כאן הבחירה בסדר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle dx\\,dy\\)</span> היא שמייצרת את הגורם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(y\\)</span> והופכת את האינטגרל לאלמנטרי.</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 4 — התוצאה (סעיף ג׳)</b><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\(\\displaystyle I=I_x+I_y={{CT:9}}+{{CT:13}}={{CT:14}}\\)</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">[[feedback:prt1]] [[feedback:prt2]]</div>", "prtcorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"correct\">תשובה נכונה.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"partially\">חלק מן התשובה נכון. בדקו את שאר הרכיבים.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"incorrect\">התשובה עדיין אינה נכונה.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 12, "insertstars": 1, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 3, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 1, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 16, "insertstars": 1, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 3, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 1, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans3", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 12, "insertstars": 1, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 3, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 1, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans4", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 16, "insertstars": 1, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 3, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 1, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans5", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 18, "insertstars": 1, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 3, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 1, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 4, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "correct:if is(equal(ans1,ymin)) and is(equal(ans2,Ix)) and is(equal(ans3,xmin)) and is(equal(ans4,Iy)) then true else false;", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "correct", "tans": "true", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיפים א׳–ב׳ — נכון.</b></div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיפים א׳–ב׳ — שגוי.</b></div>"}}]}, {"name": "prt2", "value": 2, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans5", "tans": "val", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף ג׳ — נכון.</b></div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף ג׳ — שגוי.</b></div>"}}]}], "qvnames": ["A", "B", "Bx", "By", "Ix", "Iy", "cfunc", "cx", "cy", "dfunc", "famx", "famy", "fx", "fy", "gx", "gy", "horizontal", "integrand", "mx", "my", "val", "vertical", "xmin", "xratio", "ymin", "yratio"], "nvariants": 50}